<title>UK: Depfa Finance sets 400 mln Dkr bond due Dec 2004.</title>
<headline>Depfa Finance sets 400 mln Dkr bond due Dec 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and BGL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEPFA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    30.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE	.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
